    "description": "The Media Deduplication Tool is a Python application designed to identify and eliminate duplicate images and videos from specified directories on your disk. It utilizes perceptual hashing to compare files and create a report of similar files. This tool is particularly useful for organizing large media libraries and freeing up disk space.",
